   248	Scope: every sequence of the ten words of lengths zero through four (11,111
   249	cases), plus 2,000 deterministic random sequences of lengths zero through 30
   250	using space, doubled space, tab, line feed, or CRLF separators. The independent
   251	oracle uses a word-to-rank dictionary, sorts token ranks, and joins with one
   252	space.
   253	
   254	The concrete K scope is every sequence of lengths zero through two (111 cases),
   255	four named boundary/example cases, and 100 deterministic random cases of
   256	lengths zero through 12, for 215 total. Expected strings are generated by the
   257	same independent rank-dictionary oracle. The LLVM `MPY-CONCRETE` path performs
   258	real key calls and insertion sorting rather than evaluating the opaque symbolic
   259	`sortKeyVS` term. It reported zero assertion failures/mismatches.
