   263	## Excluded behavior
   264	
   265	- Inputs containing tokens other than the ten named numerals are outside the
   266	  formal precondition; their `tuple.index` exception behavior is not modeled by
   267	  this theorem.
   268	- Unicode text and Unicode whitespace outside the supplied ASCII-oriented
